{
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "blockIndex": 0,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "我们可以用图解法解二次方程："
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "blockIndex": 1,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2+6x+5=0$。\n（1）"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "blockIndex": 2,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "不用作图能不能解这个方程？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "blockIndex": 3,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "我们由三项式 $x^2+6x+5$ 配出二项式的平方。\n如果把 $x^2$ 这一项看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $6x$ 这一项看成第一项与第二项的积的两倍，那么由恒等式 $6x=2\\cdot x\\cdot3$ 可以明显地看出，二项式的第二项是 3.\n把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $3^2$ 和 $-3^2$ 加到三项式里，得到："
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "blockIndex": 4,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2+6x+5=x^2+6x+3^2-3^2+5=(x^2+6x+9)-9+5=(x+3)^2-4$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "blockIndex": 5,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "方程（1）和下列方程同解："
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "blockIndex": 6,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$(x+3)^2-4=0$。\n（2）"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "blockIndex": 7,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "我们把方程（2）的左边作为平方差分解因式，得到："
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "blockIndex": 8,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$(x+3-2)(x+3+2)=0$，"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "blockIndex": 9,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "就是"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "blockIndex": 10,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$(x+1)(x+5)=0$。\n（3）"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "blockIndex": 11,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "方程（3）的根的集合，也就是和它同解的方程（1）根的集合，是 $\\{-5,-1\\}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "blockIndex": 12,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "我们利用在方程的左边配一个二项式的平方的方法（简称：配方法），再解几个 $ax^2+bx+c=0$（$a\\neq0$）这种形式的方程。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "blockIndex": 13,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "例 1 解方程："
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "blockIndex": 14,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2-5x+8=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "blockIndex": 15,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "由三项式 $x^2-5x+8$ 配出二项式的平方。\n如果把 $x^2$ 看成二项式第一项的平方，而把 $5x$ 看成第一项与第二项的积的两倍（$5x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}$），那么二项式的第二项是 $\\frac{5}{2}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "blockIndex": 15,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2$ 加到三项式里，得到："
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "blockIndex": 16,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2-5x+8=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}+\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2-\\frac{25}{4}+8=\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "blockIndex": 17,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "已知方程和下列方程同解："
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "blockIndex": 18,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "blockIndex": 19,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "因为当 $x$ 是任何数时，表示式 $\\left(x-\\frac{5}{2}\\right)^2+\\frac{7}{4}$ 是正的，于是所得到的方程的解集合是空集，因此方程 $x^2-5x+8=0$ 的解集合是空集。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "blockIndex": 20,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "例 2 解方程："
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "blockIndex": 21,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2-18x+81=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "blockIndex": 22,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "方程左边的三项式恒等于二项式 $x-9$ 的平方。\n就是说，这个方程可以写成："
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "blockIndex": 23,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$(x-9)^2=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "blockIndex": 24,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "显然，仅当 $x=9$ 时，方程的左边变成零。"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "blockIndex": 25,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "方程 $x^2-18x+81=0$ 只有唯一的根 9."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "blockIndex": 26,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "例 3 解方程："
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "blockIndex": 27,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$3x^2-11x-20=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "blockIndex": 28,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "用 $x^2$ 的系数除方程的两边，得到和已知方程同解的简化的二次方程："
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "blockIndex": 29,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "blockIndex": 30,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "因为 $\\frac{11}{3}x$ 可以看成 $x$ 与 $\\frac{11}{6}$ 的积的两倍（$\\frac{11}{3}x=2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}$），所以把两个大小相等符号相反的数 $\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$ 和 $-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2$ 加到三项式 $x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}$ 里以后，可以由它配出一个二项式的平方。"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "blockIndex": 30,
      "paragraphInBlock": 1,
      "text": "得到："
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "blockIndex": 31,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$x^2-\\frac{11}{3}x-\\frac{20}{3}=x^2-2\\cdot x\\cdot\\frac{11}{6}+\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{20}{3}=\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "blockIndex": 32,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "方程具有下列形式："
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "blockIndex": 33,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}\\right)^2-\\frac{361}{36}=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "blockIndex": 34,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "所得到的方程和下列方程同解："
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "blockIndex": 35,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "$\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac{19}{6}\\right)\\left(x-\\frac{11}{6}+\\frac{19}{6}\\right)=0$。"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "blockIndex": 36,
      "paragraphInBlock": 0,
      "text": "于是，也和方程 $(x-5)\\left(x+\\frac{4}{3}\\right)=0$ 同解。\n解这个方程，求出方程 $3x^2-11x-20=0$ 的解集合是 $\\left\\{-\\frac{4}{3},5\\right\\}$。"
    }
  ],
  "resolvedBreaks": [],
  "boundaries": []
}
